<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that General Instrument Corp, Iomega Corp, Silicon Graphics Inc and U.S. Surgical Corp were unavailable for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Baltimore Gas and Electric Co and Potomac Electric Power Co's preferred, preferred A and H were also not available.</p>
</text>
